uta-pitambara-dhari/","title":"Mayūra-mukuṭa"},"next":{"path":"/en/bandhu-sange-yadi-tava-ranga-parihasa/","title":"Keśi Tīrtha Upakaṇṭhe / Bandhu-saṅge"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":268,"author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur","first_line":"jaya jaya rādhā-kṛṣṇa jugala-milana"},"title":["Śrī Jugala Ārati"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["jaya jaya rādhā-kṛṣṇa jugala-milana","ārati karaye lalitādi sakhī-gaṇa"],"translation":["All glories, all glories to the meeting of the transcendental couple, Śrī Śrī Rādhā-Kṛṣṇa. The gopīs headed by Lalitā Devī perform the ceremony of Their worship."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["madana-mohana rūpa tri-bhaṅga-sundara","pītāmbara śikhi-puchchha-chūḍā-manohara"],"translation":["Kṛṣṇa is the attractor of Cupid, and His beautiful form is bending in three places. He wears yellow garments and a charming peacock-feather crown."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["lalita-mādhava-bāme vṛṣabhānu-kanyā","nīla-basanā gaurī rūpe guṇe dhanyā"],"translation":["Dressed in blue garments, Her complexion fair, and Her virtues glorious, King Vṛṣabhānu’s daughter, Śrīmatī Rādhikā is on the left of the charming Lord Mādhava."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["nānā-bidha alaṅkāra kare jhalamala","hari-mano-bimohana vadana ujjvala"],"translation":["Her various ornaments sparkle and Her effulgent face charms the heart of Lord Kṛṣṇa."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["viśākhādi sakhī-gaṇa nānā rāge gāya","priya-narma-sakhī jata chāmāra ḍhulāya"],"translation":["Viśākhā and the other girls sing songs in various tunes and moods as Kṛṣṇa’s intimate playful girlfriends fan the Divine Couple with whisks."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["śrī-rādhā-mādhava-pada-sarasija-āśe","bhakativinoda sakhī-pade sukhe bhāse"],"translation":["Yearning to attain the lotus feet of Śrī Śrī Rādhā-Kṛṣṇa, Bhakti Vinod floats in happiness at the gopīs’ feet."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/jaya-jaya-radha-krishna","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Śrī-Jugala-ārati-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/jaya-jaya-radha-krishna-jugala-milan/","description":"Śrī Jugala Ārati — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Śrī Jugala Ārati. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"jaya-jaya-radha-krishna-jugala-milan"}}